--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -3,6 +3,10 @@
 This is the source code of [Fizzy](https://fizzy.do/), the Kanban tracking tool for issues and ideas by [37signals](https://37signals.com).
 
 
+## Language
+
+Open any Fizzy page with `?locale=ja` to switch to Japanese, or `?locale=en` to switch back to English. If the URL already has a query string, append `&locale=ja` instead. The choice applies to your session and, once you sign in, is saved across your accounts and used for your email. Without an explicit choice, Fizzy uses English.
+
 ## Running your own Fizzy instance
 
 If you want to run your own Fizzy instance, but don't need to change its code, you can use our pre-built Docker image.
